+The build requires both hardened custom-engine libraries, the matching offline
+Ed25519 signing key outside this repository, and `android/key.properties`. It
+packs the exact Flutter assets from the two split AOT APKs, embeds one signed
+payload in `libpayload.so` per ABI, replaces `libflutter.so`, aligns and signs
+each APK, and verifies the final archives. Outputs are
+`build/app/outputs/flutter-apk/app-arm64-v8a-release.apk` and
+`build/app/outputs/flutter-apk/app-armeabi-v7a-release.apk`. The size and hash
+report is `build/app/outputs/packed-release-report.json`. Dart AOT stack
+symbols are saved outside the APK in a unique directory under
+`~/.local/state/kumaanime/release-symbols/` (override with
+`KUMA_SYMBOL_ROOT`). Preserve that directory and its SHA-256 hashes from the
+report for crash symbolication. If the packed build fails, the wrapper
+restores the previous verified APK pair or removes temporary stock release
+outputs. Direct `flutter build apk --release` is blocked so it cannot ship
+`flutter_assets`.
